=== PAP-1481 Option C exploratory probe (bolt-pattern symmetry) ===
Run: 2026-05-14, HARNESS=pap1481.optC-probe, n=13 same stratified cohort
Method: sample gray on rings at [0.50, 0.60, 0.70, 0.80]×aimR centred at image centre.
        Compute angular autocorrelation (N=120 samples).
        score4 = max autocorr at lag=30±1 (4-fold rotational symmetry — typical chainring spider).
        score5 = max autocorr at lag=24±1 (5-fold — Campagnolo / SRAM 5-arm).
Runtime: 902ms for 13 photos → ~70ms/photo (cheaper than Hough; Sobel-free).

